  "steps": [
    "Make the cider syrup in a small saucepan over medium heat. Mix the honey, freshly squeezed orange juice, ground ginger, cinnamon, and ground cloves. Whisk until it starts to bubble. Remove from heat for 5 minutes. If cider syrup is already available, skip this step.",
